        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi kuwada muzi ghwa Raba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimu cha ghadi na ghadi ya kwari na sumesu, ingelo wazuri wifumagha kwendalwa wuda, Joabu ukajilongoza ijeshi, ukajiwada isanga ja Waamoni. Wikacha na kughumara muzi ghwa Raba, ela Daudi ukasigharika Jerusalemu. Joabu ukaghukaba muzi ghwa Raba ukaghusima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.11.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam. 11.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ukawada kirumbu cha mzuri wawo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20.2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mzuri wawo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "angu mlungu ghwawo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kufuma chongonyi kwake; ukawona cheko na wulemeri ghwa kilo mirongo idadu na inya na andenyi yaro korekoghe na igho ja zoghori mbaa; Daudi ukachingira chongonyi kwake. Ukareda vilambo vingi nandighi viwadilo va ghuja muzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na awo wandu werekoghe andenyi ukawireda na kuwidumikisha kwa kazi ra misumeno, shilanga, na masoka; huwo niko Daudi orebonyereghe kwa mizi yose ya Waamoni. Niko Daudi chiaimweri na wandu wose wikawuya Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wuda na majitu gha Wafilisti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyuma wuda ghukabuka na Wafilisti aja Gezeri. Ngelo iyo niyo Sibekai ufumie Husha orebwaghieghe ijitu jiwangwagha Sipai, na Wafilisti wikasimwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukakaia wuda sena na Wafilisti, na Elhanani mwana wa Jairi ukam'bwagha Lahmi mruna Goliathi uo orefumieghe Gathi, nao orekoghe na ifumu jiko na mwini sa mudi ghwa mundu oluka uzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.17.4+1SA.17.5+1SA.17.6+1SA.17.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam. 17.4-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao korekoghe na wuda ghumu sena aja Gathi, na aho korekoghe na mundu umu uko na mumbi m'baa; vikoto vake verekoghe na vala virandadu, kula chimu na chwau rake rerekoghe na mano arandadu kula lumu; vala na mano ghose mirongo iwi na ana; nao moni wori orekoghe kivalwa cha wandu wiko na mimbi mibaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na iji wawidukana Waisraeli, Jonathani mwana wa Shimea, mruna Daudi, ukam'bwagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa werekoghe kivalwa cha wandu wiko na mimbi mibaa wa Gathi, nawo wikafwa kwa kubwaghwa ni Daudi na wadumiki wake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
